      "attrs": {
        "text": "MO PHONG WOKWI: TRAM TUOI CAY TU DONG IOT (ESP32 38-PIN)\nTu dong tuoi Ban Dem khi Do am < 40%, Ngat tuc thi khi >= 70% | Khoa an toan Phao can"
